{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>O.M.N.I.S.: Overnight Train</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re aboard a train that never stops.<br>Each carriage is part of a repeating routine \u2014 but something feels off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observe your surroundings closely.<br>Find anomalies.<br>Respond to the unusual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the Game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>O.M.N.I.S. \u2013 Overnight Train</strong> is a short, atmospheric walking simulator with psychological undertones.<br>Inspired by late-night train rides, liminal spaces, and the sense of being caught in an endless loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A game about repetition, perception, and losing control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Playtime:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Approximately <strong>15\u201330 minutes</strong><br>If you\u2019re observant and spot all anomalies.<br>Otherwise, the ride may take considerably longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Languages:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>English only</strong><br>No extensive language skills required \u2014 all hints are visual and intuitive.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3087790?t=1752772433","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3087790?t=1752772433","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087790/f04eca8ad4408196344b77824833bbbc7ced8570/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752772433","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087790/f04eca8ad4408196344b77824833bbbc7ced8570/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752772433","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptor